    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.resend.com/emails",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer YOUR_RESEND_API_KEY"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ from: \"Rushes QC <qc@YOUR_VERIFIED_DOMAIN.com>\", to: [ $('Normalize Job Input').item.json.notify_email || \"YOUR_TEAM@yourdomain.com\" ], subject: \"Rushes pipeline FAILED — \" + ($('Normalize Job Input').item.json.client_name || \"unknown client\"), html: \"<p>The Rushes clip pipeline failed or timed out for <strong>\" + ($('Normalize Job Input').item.json.client_name || \"unknown client\") + \"</strong>.</p><p>Source: \" + ($('Normalize Job Input').item.json.source_url || \"\") + \"</p><p>Last known status: \" + ($json.status || \"unknown\") + \" after \" + ($json.poll_count || \"?\") + \" checks.</p>\" }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "64b2822c-0039-418e-993a-34dbeb7b53ec",
      "name": "Resend: Send Failure Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Rushes clip pipeline\n\nPOST a link + brief → Reap generates clips → Claude QC-reviews every clip against the brief → Resend emails what passed and what needs a look.\n\n**Before first run:** paste your Reap / Anthropic / Resend keys into the HTTP nodes below (see SETUP.md in this folder), then move them into n8n credentials once it's working.\n\n**Polling loop:** checks Reap every 60s, gives up (and alerts) after 30 checks (~30 min) via the poll_count counter, so a stuck Reap project can't loop forever.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "adeff512-cb64-41c9-9053-de1b10104b30",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1200,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Where the API keys go\n\n- `Reap: Create Clips`, `Reap: Get Status`, `Reap: Get Clips` → `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_REAP_API_KEY`\n- `Claude: QC Review` → `x-api-key: YOUR_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`\n- `Resend: Send QC Summary`, `Resend: Send Failure Alert` → `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_RESEND_API_KEY`, plus a real `from` domain and `to` address\n\nAlso replace the QC rubric text inside `Claude: QC Review` with the client's real standardised rules once those are written down — what's there now is a starter checklist.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b57bb41e-0380-4256-a82b-eed595fd6b8a",
      "name": "Config keys",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        560
      ]
    }
  ],
